        "example": "A company receives Rs 1 Crore in share premium from unverified paper shell entities. The AO invokes Section 68. Under Section 115BBE, tax at 77.25% equals Rs 77.25 Lakh. Under Section 271AAC, a 10% penalty on tax adds Rs 6 Lakh, resulting in a total payment of Rs 83.25 Lakh on the Rs 1 Crore credit.",
        "code": "def calculate_sec115bbe_and_271aac(unexplained_addition_inr: float, included_in_return_and_tax_paid: bool) -> dict:\n    # Section 115BBE Tax Rate: Base 60% + 25% Surcharge (15%) + 4% Cess = 77.25%\n    base_tax_rate = 60.0\n    surcharge_rate = base_tax_rate * 0.25  # 15.0%\n    tax_and_surcharge = base_tax_rate + surcharge_rate  # 75.0%\n    effective_tax_rate = tax_and_surcharge * 1.04  # 77.25%\n    \n    tax_payable = unexplained_addition_inr * (effective_tax_rate / 100.0)\n    \n    # Section 271AAC Penalty: 10% of tax payable under Sec 115BBE (if not voluntarily paid)\n    if included_in_return_and_tax_paid:\n        penalty_rate = 0.0\n        penalty_payable = 0.0\n        sec271aac_status = \"Exempt under Sec 271AAC Proviso: Included in return and tax paid before year end\"\n    else:\n        penalty_rate = 10.0  # 10% of tax payable = 6% on principal\n        penalty_payable = (unexplained_addition_inr * 0.60) * 0.10 * 1.04  # 10% on tax\n        sec271aac_status = \"Mandatory 10% Penalty Levied under Section 271AAC\"\n        \n    total_effective_liability = tax_payable + penalty_payable\n    total_effective_pct = (total_effective_liability / unexplained_addition_inr) * 100.0\n    \n    return {\n        \"unexplained_addition_inr\": unexplained_addition_inr,\n        \"sec115bbe_effective_tax_pct\": effective_tax_rate,\n        \"sec115bbe_tax_payable_inr\": tax_payable,\n        \"sec271aac_penalty_inr\": penalty_payable,\n        \"total_liability_inr\": total_effective_liability,\n        \"total_effective_leakage_pct\": total_effective_pct,\n        \"status\": sec271aac_status\n    }\n\nunexplained_res = calculate_sec115bbe_and_271aac(unexplained_addition_inr=10000000.0, included_in_return_and_tax_paid=False)\nprint(f\"Unexplained Addition: INR {unexplained_res['unexplained_addition_inr']:,.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Sec 115BBE Tax (77.25%): INR {unexplained_res['sec115bbe_tax_payable_inr']:,.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Sec 271AAC Penalty: INR {unexplained_res['sec271aac_penalty_inr']:,.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Total Government Demand: INR {unexplained_res['total_liability_inr']:,.2f} ({unexplained_res['total_effective_leakage_pct']:.2f}% of addition)\")\n",
