    "goal": "Master Day 27 enterprise tax strategy: Tax Audits Form 3CD, GST Audits GSTR-9/9C, E-Invoicing Rule 48(4), ETR Optimization Ind AS 12, and Chief Tax Officer Enterprise OS.",
