        "example": "A conglomerate with Rs 12 Crore turnover files Form GSTR-9C. The finance controller self-certifies Part A and Part B, bridging Rs 12 Crore P&L turnover with Rs 12.5 Crore GST turnover by detailing Rs 50 Lakh of Schedule I inter-branch stock transfers in Table 5B. Zero unexplained variance is reported, completing statutory compliance.",
        "code": "def evaluate_gstr9c_requirement(annual_aggregate_turnover_cr: float, pnl_gross_turnover_cr: float, gstr9_reported_turnover_cr: float, unbilled_ind_as115_cr: float, advances_adjusted_cr: float) -> dict:\n    threshold_5cr = 5.0\n    is_gstr9c_mandatory = annual_aggregate_turnover_cr > threshold_5cr\n    \n    if not is_gstr9c_mandatory:\n        return {\n            \"turnover_cr\": annual_aggregate_turnover_cr,\n            \"gstr9c_mandatory\": False,\n            \"status\": \"Exempt from Form GSTR-9C: Turnover <= Rs 5 Crore\"\n        }\n        \n    # Table 5 Reconciliation\n    # Reconciled Turnover = P&L Turnover - Unbilled Revenue + Advances Adjusted\n    derived_gst_turnover = pnl_gross_turnover_cr - unbilled_ind_as115_cr + advances_adjusted_cr\n    variance_cr = abs(gstr9_reported_turnover_cr - derived_gst_turnover)\n    is_fully_reconciled = variance_cr < 0.001\n    \n    return {\n        \"turnover_cr\": annual_aggregate_turnover_cr,\n        \"gstr9c_mandatory\": True,\n        \"statutory_mechanism\": \"Self-Certification by Authorized Signatory (Finance Act 2021)\",\n        \"pnl_turnover_cr\": pnl_gross_turnover_cr,\n        \"gstr9_turnover_cr\": gstr9_reported_turnover_cr,\n        \"derived_gst_turnover_cr\": derived_gst_turnover,\n        \"unreconciled_variance_cr\": variance_cr,\n        \"is_reconciled\": is_fully_reconciled,\n        \"action\": \"Ready for Digital Signature Signoff\" if is_fully_reconciled else f\"Pay tax on unexplained variance of INR {variance_cr:.4f} Cr via DRC-03\"\n    }\n\ngstr9c_eval = evaluate_gstr9c_requirement(\n    annual_aggregate_turnover_cr=12.0,\n    pnl_gross_turnover_cr=12.0,\n    gstr9_reported_turnover_cr=12.5,\n    unbilled_ind_as115_cr=0.0,\n    advances_adjusted_cr=0.50\n)\nprint(f\"GSTR-9C Mandatory: {gstr9c_eval['gstr9c_mandatory']} (Turnover: INR {gstr9c_eval['turnover_cr']} Cr > Rs 5 Cr)\")\nprint(f\"Reconciliation Status: {gstr9c_eval['is_reconciled']} (Variance: INR {gstr9c_eval['unreconciled_variance_cr']:.4f} Cr)\")\nprint(f\"Filing Action: {gstr9c_eval['action']}\")\n",
